  (text "NO FAB / NO TX: original SG48 pinout HOLD; DAC900, mixer TX, PA and antenna absent.\nDO NOT EXPORT FABRICATION DATA; KiCad root ERC baseline 36 errors/340 warnings; release HOLD." (at 36 161 0)
